  SpeakerName: Jamie Olive Oil
  DialogueText: "Oho! Grilling, are we? A refined and respectable choice! Grilling
    chicken demands patience and precision, maintaining even heat, avoiding flare-ups,
    and mastering that perfect sear without sacrificing moisture.\r\nIt\u2019s a
    beautiful technique: smoky, aromatic, and visually stunning when done right.
    The grill rewards only those who respect it, and I admire our Contestant\u2019s
    courage in taking on such a delicate method.\r\nLet\u2019s see if they can balance
    heat and timing to create a perfectly charred masterpiece!\r\n"
